drm/rockchip: rk3066_hdmi: add audio

Based on the never merged series by Zheng Yang and Johan Jonker ("drm/rockchip:
rk3066_hdmi: add sound support", v7, June 2024), ported to the DRM bridge HDMI audio
operations of Linux 6.18. The audio settings come from that series.

